    "cuenta.gastos_generales INCOMPLETO en 5 ejercicio(s): 2020: SellingExpense (faltan GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense); 2021: SellingExpense (faltan GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense); 2022: SellingExpense (faltan GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense); 2023: SellingExpense (faltan GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense); 2024: SellingExpense (faltan GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense). Comprobar en el balance y completar a mano.",
